markdown <<MARKDOWN
# Types of Educational AI Tools

Below are a few examples of the types of education-specific AI tools that have been developed.

Take a moment to learn more about what these tools can do for you and your teaching practice.

👉 Click on each box to reveal examples from the classroom.

<div style="max-width:90%; margin:0 auto; font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial; color:#2f2f2f;">

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); gap:10px;">

<!-- Lesson Planning and Idea Generation -->
<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
<summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:0; display:block;">
<div style="padding:12px; text-align:center;">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:0px;"><span style="font-size:0.7em;">▶ </span>Lesson Planning and Idea Generation</div>
<img src="https://images.code.org/9d74b832edea5b49d8f6ff329ba52c96-Screenshot 2026-04-10 at 10.12.52 AM.png" alt="Lesson planning icon" style="width:150px; height:150px; object-fit:contain; margin-bottom:0px;">
</div>
</summary>
<div style="padding:0 16px 16px 16px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5;">
<div style="font-weight:700; margin-bottom:0px;">They can:</div>
<ul style="margin:0 0 0 18px; padding:0;">
<li style="font-size:14px;">Suggest ways to introduce or extend a topic</li>
<li style="font-size:14px;">Generate discussion questions or practice problems</li>
<li style="font-size:14px;">Help teachers move from a rough idea to a structured lesson</li>
</ul>
</div>
</details>

<!-- Instructional Materials and Content Creation -->
<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
<summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:0; display:block;">
<div style="padding:12px; text-align:center;">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:0px;"><span style="font-size:0.7em;">▶ </span>Instructional Materials and Content Creation</div>
<img src="https://images.code.org/78e1c3ab6d6d5e56955cd5c86fd15de2-Screenshot 2026-04-10 at 10.12.56 AM.png" alt="Materials creation icon" style="width:150px; height:150px; object-fit:contain; margin-bottom:0px;">
</div>
</summary>
<div style="padding:0 16px 16px 16px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5;">
<div style="font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">They can:</div>
<ul style="margin:0 0 0 18px; padding:0;">
<li style="font-size:14px;">Generate worksheets, slides, and handouts</li>
<li style="font-size:14px;">Create examples or models for student work</li>
<li style="font-size:14px;">Support visual and multimedia content creation</li>
</ul>
</div>
</details>

<!-- Differentiation and Accessibility -->
<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
<summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:0; display:block;">
<div style="padding:12px; text-align:center;">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:0px;"><span style="font-size:0.7em;">▶ </span>Differentiation and Accessibility</div>
<img src="https://images.code.org/91d0184c1dace44eae2d7acf6c86154d-Screenshot 2026-04-10 at 10.13.00 AM.png" alt="Differentiation icon" style="width:150px; height:150px; object-fit:contain; margin-bottom:0px;">
</div>
</summary>
<div style="padding:0 16px 16px 16px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5;">
<div style="font-weight:700; margin-bottom:0px;">They can:</div>
<ul style="margin:0 0 0 18px; padding:0;">
<li style="font-size:14px;">Adjust reading levels or language complexity</li>
<li style="font-size:14px;">Generate multiple versions of the same task</li>
<li style="font-size:14px;">Support multilingual learners or students needing additional scaffolds</li>
</ul>
</div>
</details>

<!-- Assessment and Feedback -->
<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
<summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:0; display:block;">
<div style="padding:12px; text-align:center;">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:0px;"><span style="font-size:0.7em;">▶ </span>Assessment and Feedback</div>
<img src="https://images.code.org/a504ed0cd168f7eaa85b322923cb1778-Screenshot 2026-04-10 at 10.13.04 AM.png" alt="Assessment icon" style="width:150px; height:150px; object-fit:contain; margin-bottom:0px;">
</div>
</summary>
<div style="padding:0 16px 16px 16px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5;">
<div style="font-weight:700; margin-bottom:0px;">They can:</div>
<ul style="margin:0 0 0 18px; padding:0;">
<li style="font-size:14px;">Help generate or refine assessments</li>
<li style="font-size:14px;">Provide structured feedback on student work</li>
<li style="font-size:14px;">Identify patterns in student responses or misconceptions</li>
</ul>
</div>
</details>

<!-- Communication and Professional Writing -->
<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
<summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:0; display:block;">
<div style="padding:12px; text-align:center;">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:0px;"><span style="font-size:0.7em;">▶ </span>Communication and Professional Writing</div>
<img src="https://images.code.org/6bee513745759c663dd38a6a701892f9-Screenshot 2026-04-10 at 10.13.07 AM.png" alt="Communication icon" style="width:150px; height:150px; object-fit:contain; margin-bottom:0px;">
</div>
</summary>
<div style="padding:0 16px 16px 16px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5;">
<div style="font-weight:700; margin-bottom:0px;">They can:</div>
<ul style="margin:0 0 0 18px; padding:0;">
<li style="font-size:14px;">Draft emails, newsletters, and reports</li>
<li style="font-size:14px;">Improve clarity, tone, and organization</li>
<li style="font-size:14px;">Help teachers communicate more efficiently with families and colleagues</li>
</ul>
</div>
</details>

<!-- Classroom Support and Insight -->
<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
<summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:0; display:block;">
<div style="padding:12px; text-align:center;">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:0px;"><span style="font-size:0.7em;">▶ </span>Classroom Support and Insight</div>
<img src="https://images.code.org/fc7a4834d504b73ddfd91068c0eecf18-Screenshot 2026-04-10 at 10.13.11 AM.png" alt="Classroom support icon" style="width:150px; height:150px; object-fit:contain; margin-bottom:0px;">
</div>
</summary>
<div style="padding:0 16px 16px 16px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5;">
<div style="font-weight:700; margin-bottom:0px;">They can:</div>
<ul style="margin:0 0 0 18px; padding:0;">
<li style="font-size:14px;">Help monitor student progress</li>
<li style="font-size:14px;">Identify where students are struggling</li>
<li style="font-size:14px;">Support personalized learning experiences</li>
</ul>
</div>
</details>
</div>
</div>

<br>

> **💬 Quick Reflection:** What's one category of tools that you'd like to try out?

